          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Framing time</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">NuNerve operates on the principle of focusing on the source of the problem behind nerve pain and discomfort. It provides a holistic approach to address the problem and ensure nerve health through healing. This is possible due to the potent mixture of natural ingredients selected based on their ability to provide relief from inflammation, repair the damage done to the nerves, and improve nerve functions. The key issues include oxidative stress, deficiency in nutrients, and inflammation.<br><br>The way that NuNerve functions involves nerve cell regeneration and protection from additional damage. The substances that have been mentioned above – Alpha-Lipoic Acid (ALA) and Benfotiamine – are famous for their ability to heal damaged nerve cells and improve the circulation of the blood within the nerves. ALA is one of the powerful antioxidants that destroy free radicals, which usually damage nerve cells. Benfotiamine is fat-soluble vitamin B1, which is crucial for energy metabolism and overall nerve tissue condition.<br><br>Besides addressing pain, NuNerve is also effective in reducing inflammation, which is part of the causes of nerve pain. Both Turmeric Root Extract and Feverfew have anti-inflammatory properties that help in reducing inflammation around the nerves and hence reduce pain and discomfort. Reducing inflammation prevents any damage to the nerve cells, making the experience comfortable for the user.<br><br>Moreover, the supplement corrects nutrient deficiencies which cause nerve problems. B12 (Methylcobalamin) and Magnesium are two essential nutrients which help ensure proper nerve health. The former aids in the development of myelin, a protective cover of nerves, whereas the latter is needed for effective nerve impulse transmission. Nutrient deficiency causes nerve disorders but, by replenishing the body with these nutrients, NuNerve improves nerve health.<br>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vyMVMAedC5",
          "_anchor": "article12-2w",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
