          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><b>NuNerve™ </b>is marketed as a dietary supplement designed to support nerve health, normal nervous system function, and everyday well-being. Its advertised formula combines B vitamins, R-alpha lipoic acid, palmitoylethanolamide (PEA), Lion's Mane mushroom, and other ingredients studied for their potential roles in neurological health.</div><br><div>Although some ingredients have been researched for nerve-related benefits, the effectiveness of the complete NuNerve formula has not necessarily been established in clinical trials.</div><br><div><b><br></b></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Normal Nerve Function –</b>&nbsp;NuNerve™ contains vitamins B1, B6, and B12, which play important roles in normal nervous system function. These nutrients help support processes involved in energy metabolism and nerve signaling. Maintaining adequate vitamin levels is important for overall neurological health, particularly when a nutritional deficiency is present.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Provides Antioxidant Support– </b>R-alpha lipoic acid and curcumin are studied for their antioxidant properties. Antioxidants help protect cells against oxidative stress, which is involved in various biological processes. However, antioxidant activity does not automatically mean that NuNerve can repair damaged nerves or prevent neurological disorders.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Healthy Vitamin B12 Levels –</b>&nbsp;Vitamin B12, listed in the form of methylcobalamin, is essential for maintaining normal nerve function and producing healthy red blood cells. Low vitamin B12 levels can contribute to neurological symptoms, including numbness and tingling. Supplementation may help address a deficiency, but people with persistent symptoms should seek medical evaluation.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Promotes Interest in Nerve Comfort – </b>NuNerve includes palmitoylethanolamide (PEA), a compound studied for its potential role in pain signaling and inflammatory responses. Researchers have investigated PEA for certain chronic pain conditions, including some nerve-related discomfort. However, the evidence varies by condition, and the effectiveness of PEA within NuNerve is not established.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Normal Energy Metabolism –</b>&nbsp;Vitamin B1, including its derivative benfotiamine, contributes to the body's ability to convert nutrients into energy. Nerve cells depend on energy to perform their normal functions. Adequate thiamine intake is particularly important for people at risk of deficiency, although additional supplementation is not guaranteed to improve energy levels in otherwise well-nourished adults.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Includes Ingredients Studied for Neurological Health –</b>&nbsp;Lion's Mane mushroom has attracted scientific interest because some of its compounds have been investigated in laboratory studies involving nerve growth pathways. Early research is promising in certain areas, but more high-quality human studies are needed. There is currently insufficient evidence to claim that Lion's Mane in NuNerve regenerates damaged nerves.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Normal Nervous System Nutritional Needs –&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>Vitamin B6, provided as pyridoxal-5-phosphate, participates in neurotransmitter production and other essential metabolic reactions. Adequate vitamin B6 intake supports normal neurological function. However, excessive intake of vitamin B6 from supplements can itself cause nerve damage, making the product's dosage an important consideration.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅OProvides Curcumin for General Wellness –</b>&nbsp;Curcumin is a naturally occurring compound in turmeric that has been studied for its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties. It may be of interest to people exploring botanical supplements as part of a wellness routine. Nevertheless, research does not establish that the amount of curcumin in NuNerve relieves nerve pain or treats neuropathy.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Complements a Healthy Lifestyle –</b>&nbsp;Nerve health depends on several factors, including balanced nutrition, regular physical activity, appropriate blood sugar management, and avoiding excessive alcohol consumption. NuNerve may be considered as a supplement within a broader wellness routine, but it cannot replace medical care or correct every underlying cause of nerve symptoms.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Offers a Multi-Ingredient Supplement Formula –</b>&nbsp;NuNerve combines vitamins, a fatty acid amide, a mushroom extract, and other compounds in one product. This may appeal to adults who prefer a combined formula instead of buying multiple individual supplements. However, the benefits and safety of the complete combination depend on its exact ingredients, dosages, and quality.</span></div></div><div><br></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
